{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1182410/extras/caefdf1fda627fbd9441c9646ac57886.poster.avif?t=1765275704\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1182410/extras/caefdf1fda627fbd9441c9646ac57886.webm?t=1765275704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1182410/extras/caefdf1fda627fbd9441c9646ac57886.mp4?t=1765275704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INTRODUCTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to your afterlife.<br>Become a <strong>Purgatory Guardian</strong>, a lone protector of souls wandering the realm between life and death. Once destined to ascend to Heaven, this Purgatory has been corrupted by ancient sins, forgotten gods, and demonic hunger. Only one warrior remains capable of restoring balance: you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Purgatory Guardian</strong> is a semi-open-world action RPG first-person shooter set in an alternate vision of Purgatory inspired by Dante\u2019s Inferno. Souls from every era collide here, each carrying their sins and the secrets they left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a guardian, you will explore ruined cities, cursed deserts, shattered temples, and forbidden archives. Meet historical figures trapped in the afterlife with unfinished legacies. Discover lost lore, mythical creatures, and hidden truths buried for centuries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1182410/extras/71ae496fbc0e4a72b55bf8bbaf5753fb.poster.avif?t=1765275704\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1182410/extras/71ae496fbc0e4a72b55bf8bbaf5753fb.webm?t=1765275704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1182410/extras/71ae496fbc0e4a72b55bf8bbaf5753fb.mp4?t=1765275704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GREATER CHALLENGES BRING GREATER REWARDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face forgotten gods, demonic rulers, twisted angels, and monstrous creatures thriving on the suffering of lost souls. Upgrade your gear, unlock powerful \u201cGifts,\u201d and shape your playstyle through strength, agility, arcane power, and advanced weapon abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master devastating attacks, brutal finishers, and supernatural powers to carve your path through the corruption. Leave demons bleeding in the ash so all may witness how far you have risen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1182410/extras/20482d3e3348e3108b0b9a738878e4fb.poster.avif?t=1765275704\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1182410/extras/20482d3e3348e3108b0b9a738878e4fb.webm?t=1765275704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1182410/extras/20482d3e3348e3108b0b9a738878e4fb.mp4?t=1765275704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RISE TOGETHER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features: </strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive, lore-rich story set in a reimagined Purgatory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend the Last City of Souls as it faces extinction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolve into the ultimate guardian through deep character progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow multiple paths and beliefs, uncovering how different cultures shaped the afterlife</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dangerous regions filled with secrets, artifacts, and powerful enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay special missions to farm rare resources and strengthen your arsenal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect unique weapons and armor to customize your combat style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a detailed codex with real historical and mythological references</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1182410/extras/1b69483f87b947df3d4d3b8676504d35.poster.avif?t=1765275704\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1182410/extras/1b69483f87b947df3d4d3b8676504d35.webm?t=1765275704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1182410/extras/1b69483f87b947df3d4d3b8676504d35.mp4?t=1765275704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEMO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The free demo includes one full campaign stage and one additional side quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guardian tasks will have you return to corrupted locations to maintain peace and stability in those regions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mature Content Description   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains mature themes not suitable for all audiences, including frequent violence and gore, dark religious themes, nudity, and other adult content.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1182410?t=1765275704","backgroun