1765275704"},{"id":8,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1182410/ss_ec470761cfdd6399b0e5a671682053c99860f66b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1765275704","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1182410/ss_ec470761cfdd6399b0e5a671682053c99860f66b.600x338.jpg?t=1765275704"}],"short_description":"In the corrupted depths of Purgatory, demons and forgotten gods rule the damned. Rise as a guardian, hunt the darkness alone, gather souls to forge powerful weapons, unlock supernatural abilities, and face creatures born from ancient sins and hidden horrors ready to strike.","steam_appid":1182410,"support_info":{"email":"support@purgatoryguardian.com","url":"www.purgatoryguardian.com"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://purgatoryguardian.com"}